  "name": "Athens Insomnia Scale (AIS)",
  "short_name": null,
  "language": "en",
  "description": "The Athens Insomnia Scale (AIS) is an 8-item self-report measure of insomnia severity in adults. It quantifies sleep difficulty against the ICD-10 diagnostic criteria for nonorganic insomnia, counting only difficulties that occurred at least three times a week over the past month.",
